  "title": "Battle of Three Kings",
  "summary": "On 4 August 1578 near Ksar el-Kebir in northern Morocco, the Saadi sultan ʿAbd al-Malik defeated an invading Portuguese army under King Sebastian. Sebastian, ʿAbd al-Malik and the ousted sultan Abdallah Muhammad all died, hence the name. Sebastian's death without an heir left Portugal under Spanish control for the next 60 years.",
